=You are an executive document styling engine for Ciketo Logistics.
Given the structured order information below, generate a polished, highly professional standalone HTML document (<!DOCTYPE html><html>...</html>) with modern clean inline CSS for an Order Detail Summary / Freight Booking Confirmation PDF:

Order ID: {{ $json.order_id }}
Customer Name: {{ $json.customer_name }}
Company: {{ $json.company_name }}
Email: {{ $json.email }}
Phone: {{ $json.phone }}
Origin Port: {{ $json.origin }}
Destination Port: {{ $json.destination }}
Shipping Method: {{ $json.shipping_method }}
Cargo: {{ $json.cargo_description }}
Weight: {{ $json.weight_kg }} kg
Packages: {{ $json.packages }}
Departure Date: {{ $json.preferred_departure_date }}
Estimated Delivery Date: {{ $json.estimated_delivery_date }}
Amount: {{ $json.amount }} {{ $json.currency }}
Special Notes: {{ $json.notes }}
Status: Order Placed

Design requirements: Dark slate header (#0f172a) with bold CIKETO LOGISTICS branding, blue accent (#2563eb), 2-column cards for Shipper and Route details, cargo specs table, commercial total, verification tracking link, and 24/7 support email. Return strictly raw HTML without markdown codeblocks.

